{"ref":"BDB, עוֹבֵד","hw":"עוֹבֵד","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עוֹבֵד</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֹבֵד</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>worshipper;</em> cf. Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">עבד</span> Os<sup>22</sup> and DHM<sup>ZMG xxxvii (1883), 14</sup>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  son of Boaz and Ruth <a data-ref=\"Ruth 4:17\" href=\"/Ruth.4.17\">Ru 4:17</a>, v <a data-ref=\"Ruth 4:21\" href=\"/Ruth.4.21\">21</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.12\">1 Ch 2:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ruth 4:22\" href=\"/Ruth.4.22\">Ru 4:22</a> (only here <span dir=\"rtl\">עֹבֵד</span>) = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.12\">1 Ch 2:12</a>, 𝔖 Ωβηδ.<br><strong>2.</strong>  names in Judah, 𝔊 Ωβηδ: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:37\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.37\">1 Ch 2:37</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.38\">38</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.1\">2 Ch 23:1</a>.<strong>)</strong><br><strong>3.</strong>  a mighty man of David <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:47\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.47\">1 Ch 11:47</a>, 𝔊 Ιωβηθ, A Ιωβηδ.<br><strong>4.</strong>  a doorkeeper <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.7\">1 Ch 26:7</a>, 𝔊 Ωβηδ.","next":"BDB, עֹבֵד אֱדֹם","prev":"BDB, עֲבָד"}